{"id":"995551831","kind":"answer","title":"记忆力不好，怎么才能在短时间内最大限度的学习知识？学习方法都有哪些？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2020-02-02","updated":"2020-02-04","votes":17,"comment_count":1,"minutes":1,"chars":355,"keywords":["间隔重复","长期记忆","检索练习","Anki","遗忘曲线"],"summary":"短时间 、 最大限度 从记忆理论上来说： 间隔重复 + 测试效应 两者结合效果很好，但是只是理论，以我刷知乎的个人经验，只有理论的回答几乎帮不上忙 所以我就介绍一下可以半个小时内开始，并能坚持一年以上的实际操作方法：借助 Anki 来进行学习。 先发几张使用过程中的图片 简单介绍：Anki 是一款有 记忆 辅助算法的 笔记 软…","question_detail_html":"<p>我的提问可能不是很好回答，不容易找到切入点，如果不知道怎么回答，可以把自己的学习过程写下来。</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/366141776/answer/995551831","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"wtzjrI2J\"><b>短时间</b>、<b>最大限度</b></p><p data-pid=\"iV-DzwRQ\">从记忆理论上来说：</p><p data-pid=\"LjpmU95x\"><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57020308\" href=\"#/post/57020308\">间隔重复</a>+ <a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"57113246\" href=\"#/post/57113246\">测试效应</a></p><p data-pid=\"100i2Pup\">两者结合效果很好，但是只是理论，以我刷知乎的个人经验，只有理论的回答几乎帮不上忙</p><p data-pid=\"e_HZa3ZT\">所以我就介绍一下可以半个小时内开始，并能坚持一年以上的实际操作方法：借助 Anki 来进行学习。</p><p data-pid=\"U32bTL8m\">先发几张使用过程中的图片</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-1af7c2ed8d2a18aa49d96d4fb8526b2a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-1af7c2ed8d2a18aa49d96d4fb8526b2a_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1062\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-1af7c2ed8d2a18aa49d96d4fb8526b2a\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-1af7c2ed8d2a18aa49d96d4fb8526b2a_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1062\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"908\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"908\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-e7ad740624dfbd49014261a378e5255c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-e7ad740624dfbd49014261a378e5255c_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"634\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-e7ad740624dfbd49014261a378e5255c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-e7ad740624dfbd49014261a378e5255c_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"634\"/></figure><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-2eb3267a69879acc88634e8c4e328d33\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-2eb3267a69879acc88634e8c4e328d33_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1062\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-2eb3267a69879acc88634e8c4e328d33\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-2eb3267a69879acc88634e8c4e328d33_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1062\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"dlLgSPlt\">简单介绍：Anki 是一款有<b>记忆</b>辅助算法的<b>笔记</b>软件，支持常见的 windows、mac、linux、安卓和 ios 系统。</p><p data-pid=\"tIcxcuU7\">快速入门方式：</p><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.kancloud.cn/ankigaokao/ankigaokao/785046\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">目录 · Anki 备战高考手册</a><p data-pid=\"uImDAXT2\">最后，说一些自己踩过的坑：</p><p data-pid=\"o_yA3cFH\">千万不要看太多学习方法，实践为主。以及，没有给出理论和实际相结合的学习方法，哪怕再科学与正确，也没有多大用处，反而会给人带来一种感觉良好。</p><p data-pid=\"zuzVqVnw\">最后，给一下我自己高考前的学习统计数据：</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-f574c9463a44f5ccd3d3bc54c7b23b86\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f574c9463a44f5ccd3d3bc54c7b23b86_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1665\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-f574c9463a44f5ccd3d3bc54c7b23b86\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-f574c9463a44f5ccd3d3bc54c7b23b86_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1665\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"abyeHayR\">不妨抽帮个小时，少看几篇理论，多实践一个方法。</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"57020308","title":"【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"},{"id":"57113246","title":"【理论】测试效应——什么？考试有助于我的学习？","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":105,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 1 核心引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"46855765","title":"使用Anki准备大型考试的设置","author":"Anki","votes":41,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46533104","title":"疑问:Anki 没有向我展示我的所有卡片！","author":"Anki","votes":12,"minutes":11,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"38306259","title":"简单常见记忆误区解惑","author":"SuperMemo","votes":29,"minutes":6,"reason":"延伸深读 · SuperMemo"},{"id":"46856037","title":"我要去度假。我可以暂停复习程序吗？","author":"Anki","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"6046109771","title":"如何追赶积压的 Anki 复习任务","author":"Soren Bjornstad","votes":209,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Soren Bjornstad"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"1005545481","title":"有哪些实用学习的APP可以推荐一下？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":66,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 66 赞同"},{"id":"1882739659","title":"Anki 怎么用高效？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":241,"minutes":2,"reason":